<h1>Travis Hunter's <em>Two-Way Return</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 6 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>⚡ Jaguars · Season Preview</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">Travis Hunter enters his second NFL season healthy after a knee injury limited him to just seven games as a rookie — and the Jaguars still plan to play the reigning Heisman winner at both cornerback and wide receiver. Hunter is one of the rare modern prospects who skipped combine testing entirely, betting that his game tape said more than a stopwatch ever could. A year later, that bet is being put to the test in the most physically demanding role in football.</p>
</div><div class="content">
<div class="toc">
