<h2 id="measurements">Measurements Without a Combine Workout</h2>
<p>Unlike almost every other top prospect in his draft class, Hunter didn't run a 40-yard dash, jump a vertical, or complete a single testing drill at the 2025 combine. He opted to let his college production and film speak for him, choosing instead to display his athleticism at Colorado's pro day. His official combine measurements were still notable: 6-foot-0, 188 pounds, with a 31 3/8-inch arm length — a lean, sturdy frame that answered early questions about whether he had enough size to hold up on both sides of the ball.</p>
