<div class="faq-a">No. Hunter opted out of all on-field testing at the 2025 NFL Combine, choosing to showcase his athleticism through game film and a limited pro day workout instead.</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<div class="faq-q">What position does Travis Hunter play?</div>
<div class="faq-a">Hunter plays both cornerback and wide receiver for the Jacksonville Jaguars, a true two-way role that is essentially unprecedented in the modern NFL.</div>
</div>
